---
description: Minimal repository-wide safety and persona routing
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Work from the Git root and use repository-relative paths in durable files. Read `README.md`, then apply exactly one persona rule: `maintainer`, `operator`, or `use-case-creator`. Finish the primary workflow before applying another persona. Search before reading and open only files required by the selected workflow. Never load the full documentation tree by default.

Keep secrets and environment IDs out of committed files. External deploy, publish, share, sign, activate, delete, or reset actions require explicit approval and confirmed targets.
